### Import the current reading from Open-Meteo for a location
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/import-current/{{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Import the current reading - 404 Not Found (location does not exist)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/import-current/999999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Import the current reading - 401 Unauthorized (missing API key)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/import-current/{{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}}

### Delete a reading - 404 Not Found
DELETE {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/999999
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### Delete a reading - 401 Unauthorized (missing API key)
DELETE {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/{{createReading.response.body.$.reading.id}}

### Delete a reading
DELETE {{hostAddress}}/api/readings/{{createReading.response.body.$.reading.id}}
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

### =========================================================
### Alerts
### =========================================================

### Create a reading to attach an alert to
# @name createAlertsReading
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/readings
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "locationId": {{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}},
  "dateTime": "2026-07-06T10:00:00",
  "temperature": 20,
  "humidity": 50,
  "windSpeed": 10,
  "precipitation": 0,
  "pm10": 10,
  "pm25": 10,
  "europeanAqi": 10
}

### Create an alert manually
# @name createAlert
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "locationId": {{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}},
  "readingId": {{createAlertsReading.response.body.$.reading.id}},
  "alertType": "Temperature",
  "warningLevel": "High",
  "message": "Temperatura elevada registada para esta localização."
}

### Create an alert - 400 Bad Request (LocationId does not exist)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "locationId": 999999,
  "readingId": {{createAlertsReading.response.body.$.reading.id}},
  "alertType": "Temperature",
  "warningLevel": "High",
  "message": "Temperatura elevada registada para esta localização."
}

### Create an alert - 400 Bad Request (ReadingId does not exist)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "locationId": {{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}},
  "readingId": 999999,
  "alertType": "Temperature",
  "warningLevel": "High",
  "message": "Temperatura elevada registada para esta localização."
}

### Create an alert - 401 Unauthorized (missing API key)
POST {{hostAddress}}/api/alerts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": {{createReadingsLocation.response.body.$.id}},
  "readingId": {{createAlertsReading.response.body.$.reading.id}},
  "alertType": "Temperature",
  "warningLevel": "High",
  "message": "Temperatura elevada registada para esta localização."
}

